<title>FINLAND: Nokia signs $500 mln US commercial paper.</title>
<headline>Nokia signs $500 mln US commercial paper.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecoms group Nokia Oy said on Wednesday it had signed a $500 million U.S. commercial paper program with an A1 rating by Standard &amp; Poor's and a P-1 rating by Moody's.</p>
<p>&quot;The dealers of the program are Credit Suisse First Boston (CSFB) and Merrill Lynch, and the issuing and paying agent is Citibank,&quot; Nokia said.</p>
</text>
